; 2026 transactions. Rename this file to your first fiscal year and update
; the include in main.ledger. Uncomment and edit the examples below, or
; delete them. See docs/ledger-cheatsheet.md for more patterns.

; Declares the accounts so Paisa's editor can check this file on its own
include accounts.ledger

; Founder buys shares when the company is incorporated
; 2026/01/01 Share issuance | Class A shares to founder
;     Assets:Bank:Chequing                        100.00 CAD
;     Equity:ShareCapital:ClassA:Founder         -100.00 CAD  ; Shares: 100

; Incorporation filing paid personally by the founder (company owes it back)
; 2026/01/01 BC Registries | Incorporation filing
;     Expenses:Incorporation                      350.00 CAD
;     Liabilities:ShareholderLoan

; Sale with GST 5% + BC PST 7%
; 2026/01/15 Invoice 1001 | Customer name
;     Assets:AccountsReceivable                 1,120.00 CAD
;     Income:Sales                             -1,000.00 CAD
;     Liabilities:GST:Collected                   -50.00 CAD
;     Liabilities:PST:Collected                   -70.00 CAD
